					<div class="svg9"><div class="svz"><span class="iw"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 19V5M4 19h16"/><path d="M8 15l3.5-4 3 2.5L19 8"/></svg></span><h3>SEO for Beauty</h3><p>Own "barbershop near me," "fade haircut Dubai" and every search that drives walk-ins and bookings.</p></div><div class="svz"><span class="iw"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg></span><h3>Google Ads</h3><p>Capture "men's grooming near me" searches at the exact moment someone needs a fast, reliable cut.</p></div><div class="svz"><span class="iw"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 11l16-6-4 14-5-4-3 3v-5z"/></svg></span><h3>Meta Ads (FB &amp; IG)</h3><p>Sharp before/after fade and beard content targeted precisely to men in your area.</p></div><div class="svz"><span class="iw"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H4l2-3a8 8 0 1 1 15-5z"/></svg></span><h3>AI Booking Bot</h3><p>Books lunch-break trims and evening slots 24/7 — no phone tag, no lost walk-ins.</p></div><div class="svz"><span class="iw"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg></span><h3>Websites &amp; Landing Pages</h3><p>Fast-loading sites with real-time availability — built for men who book in under a minute.</p></div><div class="svz"><span class="iw"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l1.8 4.6L18 9l-4.2 1.4L12 15l-1.8-4.6L6 9l4.2-1.4z"/><path d="M18 15l.9 2.1L21 18l-2.1.9L18 21l-.9-2.1L15 18l2.1-.9z"/></svg></span><h3>Social Media Management</h3><p>Reels showing real cuts, real fades, real transformations — the content that actually converts here.</p></div><div class="svz"><span class="iw"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 7h12l1 13H5z"/><path d="M9 10V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v4"/></svg></span><h3>Ecommerce</h3><p>Sell beard oils, grooming kits and retail products online between chair appointments.</p></div><div class="svz"><span class="iw"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l2.7 5.5 6 .9-4.3 4.2 1 6-5.4-2.8L6.6 19.6l1-6L3.3 9.4l6-.9z"/></svg></span><h3>Reviews &amp; Reputation</h3><p>Systematic review growth — men decide fast, and star rating is the first thing they check.</p></div><div class="svz"><span class="iw"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.2" cy="6.8" r="1"/></svg></span><h3>Growth Bundle</h3><p>Combine channels into one strategy built around your repeat-visit cycle and chair capacity.</p></div></div>				</div>
