				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-710bd5ea elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="710bd5ea" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="text-align:center">Every grooming category has different frequency and value. Tap one to see how we market it.</p>								</div>
