				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ac91bf elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="ac91bf" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
					<div class="gxz"><input type="radio" name="gxt" id="gxt0" checked><input type="radio" name="gxt" id="gxt1"><input type="radio" name="gxt" id="gxt2"><input type="radio" name="gxt" id="gxt3"><input type="radio" name="gxt" id="gxt4"><div class="tbs"><label for="gxt0">Cuts &amp; Fades</label><label for="gxt1">Beard &amp; Hot Towel Shaves</label><label for="gxt2">Hair &amp; Scalp Treatments</label><label for="gxt3">Skin &amp; Facials</label><label for="gxt4">Grooming Packages</label></div><div class="pnl x0"><div><h3>Cuts &amp; Fades</h3><p>The core, highest-frequency booking — clients return every 2-4 weeks and often follow one preferred barber closely. Portfolio content showing specific fades and textured crops converts far better than generic salon photography.</p><div class="tg"><span>Highest frequency</span><span>Barber loyalty matters</span><span>Style-specific search</span></div></div><div class="ds"><div class="d"><span>Top search term</span><b>Skin fade near me</b></div><div class="d"><span>Typical cycle</span><b>Every 2–4 weeks</b></div><div class="d"><span>Best channel</span><b>Instagram + SEO</b></div></div></div><div class="pnl x1"><div><h3>Beard Grooming &amp; Hot Towel Shaves</h3><p>Often booked alongside a cut, but increasingly a standalone repeat service on its own — sharp beard lines and shape maintenance is a distinct, high-frequency add-on that pairs well with membership pricing.</p><div class="tg"><span>Frequent standalone bookings</span><span>Pairs with cuts</span><span>Precision-focused search</span></div></div><div class="ds"><div class="d"><span>Top search term</span><b>Beard trim near me</b></div><div class="d"><span>Typical cycle</span><b>Every 2–3 weeks</b></div><div class="d"><span>Best channel</span><b>Google Ads + Maps</b></div></div></div><div class="pnl x2"><div><h3>Hair &amp; Scalp Treatments</h3><p>Keratin therapy, PRP for hair growth and scalp detox — a fast-growing, higher-margin category as hair loss concerns drive men toward barbershops offering real treatment options, not just style maintenance.</p><div class="tg"><span>Fast-growing category</span><span>Higher margin</span><span>Concern-driven search</span></div></div><div class="ds"><div class="d"><span>Top search term</span><b>PRP hair treatment Dubai</b></div><div class="d"><span>Typical cycle</span><b>Multi-session packages</b></div><div class="d"><span>Best channel</span><b>SEO + Website</b></div></div></div><div class="pnl x3"><div><h3>Skin &amp; Facial Treatments</h3><p>"Skin-first" grooming is a real, growing trend — men adopting facials and basic skincare routines through their barbershop, an entry point most competitors haven't caught onto yet.</p><div class="tg"><span>Emerging trend</span><span>Low competitor awareness</span><span>Cross-sell opportunity</span></div></div><div class="ds"><div class="d"><span>Top search term</span><b>Men's facial Dubai</b></div><div class="d"><span>Typical cycle</span><b>Monthly</b></div><div class="d"><span>Best channel</span><b>Instagram + Reviews</b></div></div></div><div class="pnl x4"><div><h3>Grooming Packages &amp; Memberships</h3><p>Given the short repeat cycle, membership-style packages (cut + beard + facial bundled monthly) convert exceptionally well here — clients who'd book weekly anyway get real value, and revenue becomes predictable.</p><div class="tg"><span>Ideal repeat-cycle fit</span><span>Predictable revenue</span><span>High retention</span></div></div><div class="ds"><div class="d"><span>Decision driver</span><b>Convenience + value</b></div><div class="d"><span>Typical cycle</span><b>Monthly recurring</b></div><div class="d"><span>Best channel</span><b>Email + AI Bot follow-up</b></div></div></div></div>				</div>
