				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-37b25302 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="37b25302" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); font-size: 14px; color: #d9d5e4;"><b style="font-family: Space Grotesk,sans-serif; color: #c6f432; min-width: 96px;">2-4wk</b>repeat cycle — shortest in beauty and grooming</div><div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); font-size: 14px; color: #d9d5e4;"><b style="font-family: Space Grotesk,sans-serif; color: #c6f432; min-width: 96px;">5</b>service categories, from cuts to facials</div><div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); font-size: 14px; color: #d9d5e4;"><b style="font-family: Space Grotesk,sans-serif; color: #c6f432; min-width: 96px;">Packages</b>convert exceptionally well at this cycle length</div><div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); font-size: 14px; color: #d9d5e4;"><b style="font-family: Space Grotesk,sans-serif; color: #c6f432; min-width: 96px;">Fast decisions</b>mean reviews and portfolio matter most</div>								</div>
