														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Why does the repeat cycle matter so much for marketing strategy?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1381" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="1" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1381"><p>At every 2-4 weeks, a barbershop&#8217;s marketing needs a much faster content and offer cadence than a salon or clinic booking monthly or quarterly — and it makes membership-style packages unusually effective, since clients would book that often anyway.</p></div>
