														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Should we be marketing skincare and facials if we're primarily a barbershop?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1382" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="2" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1382"><p>If you already offer them, yes — &#8220;skin-first&#8221; grooming is a real, growing trend in the UAE and most competitors haven&#8217;t caught onto marketing it properly yet, making it a genuine differentiation opportunity.</p></div>
				</div>
