														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Can the AI bot handle our lunch-break rush?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1383" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="3" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1383"><p>Yes — it&#8217;s built for exactly this kind of high-frequency, time-sensitive booking, checking real availability and confirming instantly rather than putting someone on hold.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-1384" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="4" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-1384" aria-expanded="false">
