												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Do grooming packages actually work for barbershops?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1384" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="4" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1384"><p>Very well, specifically because of the short repeat cycle — bundling cut, beard and other services into a monthly package gives clients real value while converting one-off visits into predictable recurring revenue.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-1385" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="5" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-1385" aria-expanded="false">
