					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1385" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="5" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1385"><p>Extremely — men researching a new barbershop tend to decide quickly, often from star rating and a few photos alone, so review volume does more work here than in categories with longer research phases.</p></div>
				</div>
